        "Stafsjö publishes through-going, uni-directional, high-pressure and specialised knife-gate valve ranges, together with pneumatic, hydraulic, electric and manual actuation options and accessories. Its documented applications include pulp and paper, mineral processing and tailings, water and wastewater, biomass, food, marine and other demanding process systems."
