      "shortDescription": "Tapflo AB manufactures industrial pumps and complete flow systems. Its official portfolio includes air- and electrically operated diaphragm pumps, centrifugal, hose, dosing and submersible pumps, mixers, filters, hygienic valves and engineered process units.",
