        "Official Tapflo sources identify the business as an independent Swedish family-owned manufacturer founded in 1980 and headquartered in Kungälv. The company designs, produces and supplies pumps and complete flow-handling systems for industrial process applications.",
        "The documented product range covers pneumatic and electric diaphragm pumps, filter-press pumps, centrifugal and peristaltic hose pumps, submersible and metering pumps, pulsation dampeners, mixers, filters, hygienic valves and configured unloading, blending, filling and skid-mounted systems. Published sectors include chemical and petrochemical processing, pharmaceutical and biotechnology, food and beverage, paper, cosmetics, electroplating, mechanical engineering and water treatment."
