      "statusModifier": "GROUP_BRAND",
      "shortDescription": "VACUUBRAND develops and manufactures vacuum equipment for laboratories and industrial processes. Its official range covers diaphragm, screw and rotary-vane pumps, aspiration systems, vacuum gauges, controllers, local vacuum networks and accessories.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official VACUUBRAND sources identify VACUUBRAND GMBH + CO KG as a German vacuum-technology company headquartered in Wertheim. Its history records the first VACUUBRAND vacuum pump in 1961 and the establishment of the current independent company in 1985 within Brand Group.",
        "The documented portfolio includes oil-free diaphragm and screw pumps, oil-sealed rotary-vane pumps, fluid aspiration systems, chemical-resistant vacuum gauges, process controllers, local vacuum networks and accessories. Published applications include rotary evaporation, filtration, drying, reactors and synthesis, distillation, lyophilisation, Schlenk lines, degassing, high-vacuum backing, coating and laboratory fluid aspiration."
      ],
